  <data key="d2">Evers S is a researcher who contributed to guidelines on the drug treatment of migraine.&lt;SEP&gt;Evers S is an author of academic literature on oxygen use in cluster headache treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Evers S is a researcher who published a review on treatment of headache with botulinum toxin A according to evidence-based medicine criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9666bb1f91905773a4411559f12b0410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cddaa60186a583b48d21588a10557f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e949ceaa91563d5020dfddbce0137142</data>
  <data key="d4">iMD - Uptodate - Acute treatment of migraine in adults(1).PDF&lt;SEP&gt;iMD - Uptodate - Cluster headache_ Treatment and prognosis.PDF</data>
