<node id="Safety and efficacy of occipital nerve stimulation for attack prevention in medically intractable chronic cluster headache (ICON)">
  <data key="d0">Safety and efficacy of occipital nerve stimulation for attack prevention in medically intractable chronic cluster headache (ICON)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Safety and efficacy of occipital nerve stimulation for attack prevention in medically intractable chronic cluster headache (ICON) is a randomised, double-blind, multicentre, phase 3 trial.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7f561f3e1980fae1e2fbac5ed5564517</data>
