<edge source="NSAIDs" target="Triptans">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The combined use of a triptan and a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID) appears to be more effective than triptan alone.&lt;SEP&gt;The combined use of an NSAID with a triptan appears to be more effective than using either drug class alone.</data>
