<edge source="NSAIDs" target="Intracranial Bleeding">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Use of anticoagulants or nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs), including aspirin, increases the risk of intracranial bleeding.</data>
