<edge source="Ubrogepant" target="Placebo">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ubrogepant 100 mg and 50 mg doses showed greater pain freedom at two hours compared with placebo (21.2, 19.2, and 11.8 percent, respectively).&lt;SEP&gt;Ubrogepant is compared against placebo in the ACHIEVE II trial.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical trial,comparison,efficacy,treatment comparison</data>
