</edge>
<edge source="Placebo" target="Valproate">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A two-week double-blind randomized controlled trial found no statistically significant difference between treatment with valproate (1000 to 2000 mg daily) and placebo.</data>
