</edge>
<edge source="Placebo" target="Indomethacin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">There are reports of occasional patients meeting diagnostic criteria for cluster headache who responded to indomethacin when used for several weeks at higher doses (≥225 mg daily), though it is considered ineffective in the short term.</data>
