</edge>
<edge source="Placebo" target="Hyperbaric oxygen">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A small placebo-controlled, double-blind trial found that hyperbaric oxygen was ineffective in preventing cluster headache attacks.</data>
