  <data key="d8">Pretreatment pain severity was the strongest predictor of headache relief and pain-free response two hours after taking sumatriptan.&lt;SEP&gt;Sumatriptan is a triptan medication used for acute migraine treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Sumatriptan is used for acute migraine treatment, with studies focusing on its effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Sumatriptan is compared with dihydroergotamine in the treatment of acute migraine.</data>
