  <data key="d8">An oral or rectal antiemetic drug can be used in conjunction with simple or combination analgesics for attacks associated with severe nausea or vomiting.</data>
  <data key="d9">concomitant use,nausea management</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2878ee960479fec5e0fd7c97d6d44f85</data>
