<edge source="Triptans" target="Monoamine Oxidase Inhibitors">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Combination with monoamine oxidase inhibitors is relatively contraindicated with triptans because of the risk of serotonin syndrome.</data>
