<edge source="Triptans" target="SSRIs">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Concerns have been raised about serotonin syndrome in patients who use triptans in combination with a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI).</data>
  <data key="d9">drug interaction,serotonin syndrome</data>
