<edge source="Triptans" target="Calcitonin Gene-Related Peptide (CGRP)">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Triptans reduce the levels of calcitonin gene-related peptide (CGRP) to mediate their effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Triptans inhibit transmission in the trigeminal nucleus caudalis, blocking afferent input by reducing the levels of calcitonin gene-related peptide (CGRP).</data>
  <data key="d9">mechanism of action,peptide reduction,pharmacological effect</data>
