</edge>
<edge source="Triptans" target="Cluster headache">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Oral naratriptan and frovatriptan have limited data suggesting benefit for cluster headache prevention, while oral sumatriptan was found not effective for preventing attacks.</data>
  <data key="d9">drug specificity,treatment efficacy</data>
