</edge>
<edge source="Acetaminophen" target="Aspirin-Acetaminophen-Caffeine">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The combination of acetaminophen-aspirin-caffeine was found to alleviate headaches in patients with uncomplicated migraine.</data>
