  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">New persistent daily headache is a less common primary headache disorder included in the evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical presentation,headache classification</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-469ba9f85eff0d1ef2fc5b0807c28e01</data>
