<edge source="Altered Mental Status" target="Syncope">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Any change in mental status, personality, or fluctuation in the level of consciousness suggests a potentially serious abnormality; Syncope or near-syncope at headache onset is suggestive of SAH.</data>
